ction\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Function</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">An interactable radar that will display when the next weather event will occur, as well as what that event will be&#160;!</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p>\nType: Structures</p><figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 255px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/de/Weather_Radar_Unboxed.png/revision/latest?cb=20250810173410\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Weather Radar Unboxed\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/de/Weather_Radar_Unboxed.png/revision/latest?cb=20250810173410\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"255\" height=\"541\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Weather Radar Unboxed.png\" data-image-key=\"Weather_Radar_Unboxed.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Weather_Radar_Unboxed.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Weather Radar Unboxed</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure><p>The <b>Weather Radar</b> is a purchasable structure found in the <b><a href=\"/wiki/Gizmo%27s_Observatory\" title=\"Gizmo&#39;s Observatory\">Gizmo's Observatory</a>.</b>\n</p><p>Once placed, if you interact with the radar it will tell you the next weather event/current weather.\n</p><p>The radar has its own chat name (Noah The Radar) and will have a text bubble on top of the radar when telling you the next weather event and current.\n</p><p>The weather radar can be activated through the use of an <a href=\"/wiki/Interactor\" title=\"Interactor\">Interactor</a> and can be automated by connecting a <a href=\"/wiki/Weather_Sensor\" title=\"Weather Sensor\">Weather Sensor</a> to an <a href=\"/wiki/Interactor\" title=\"Interactor\">Interactor</a> to it.\n</p>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 466px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/2f/Weather_Radar_Chat_popup.png/revision/latest?cb=20250810172621\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Weather Radar Chat Text\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/2f/Weather_Radar_Chat_popup.png/revision/latest?cb=20250810172621\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"466\" height=\"34\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Weather Radar Chat popup.png\" data-image-key=\"Weather_Radar_Chat_popup.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Weather_Radar_Chat_popup.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Weather Radar explaining in chat what the current weather is, when the next one will be and what it will be.</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903155941\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.038 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.047 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 49/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 51/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\n